ge <a href=\"page164.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Public baths</a>.<br>17 October, 2023: Added to townscapes in Japan: Matsugaoka, Sakata, Yunohama, and Yutagawa (Yamagata).<br>15 October, 2023: Added to townscapes in Japan: Kawagoe, Yui, Yui Kurasawa,  Nissaka &amp; Kanbara (Shizuoka); Reisenji Onsen (Nagano).<br></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center py-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
